 was a feeling of resentment in the office after everyone's pay was lowered."}]},{"headword":"fury","usage":"n.暴怒，大怒，程度较anger要强。"},{"headword":"anger","usage":"n.气愤，生气，是一般用语。","exam_sents":[{"chn_sent":"争吵之后，他一拳打在那个人的脸上以发泄怒气。","eng_sent":"After their argument, he expressed his anger by punching the other man in the face."}]},{"headword":"indignation","usage":"n.义愤，尤其指出于道义上的激愤。","exam_sents":[{"chn_sent":"公共汽车票价突然猛增激起的公愤","eng_sent":"general indignation at the sudden steep rise in bus fares"}]}],"headwords":["resentment","fury","anger","indignation"],"tran":"愤怒、生气"},{"source":"http://wenku.baidu.com/view/40c2bfec81c758f5f61f671b.html","usages":[{"headword":"fury","usage":"语气最强，指极端的气愤，甚至达到发疯的程度。"},{"headword":"anger","usage":"普通用词，通常指因受到侮辱、损害、指责或顶撞等而引起的愤怒。"},{"headword":"wrath","usage":"文学用词，含义与anger相近，但语气强，含欲加惩罚或报复的意味。"},{"headword":"rage","usage":"侧重突然而猛列发作，难以控制的大怒。"},{"headword":"indignation","usage":"较正式用词，指出于正义或对不公正之事而发出的愤怒。"}],"headwords":["fury","anger","wrath","rage","indignation"],"tran":"愤怒"}],"return-phrase":"愤怒"},"lang":"eng","newhh":{"dataList":[{"note":"不宜写作“忿怒”。","pinyin":"fènnù","cat":"形容词","sense":[{"def":["非常生气"],"examples":["<self>愤怒</self>斥责敌人的罪行。"],"cat":"形容词"}],"word":"愤怒"}],"source":{"name":"《现代汉语规范词典》"},"word":"愤怒"}}